        "name": "Elon Musk"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2110750157272719562",
    "text": "Today, we’re expanding our Nemotron family of open models with Nemotron 3.5 Super VL. \n\nBringing visual understanding, reasoning, and tool use together to help AI agents complete more work in less time. \n\nOpen models ➡️ more control to customize, deploy, and build on your own terms.\n\nDive into what’s new:",
    "author": {
      "id": "61559439",
      "name": "NVIDIA",
      "screenName": "nvidia",
      "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1828904711124078593/SRvCZSfQ_normal.jpg",
      "verified": true
    },
    "metrics": {
