    "quotedTweet": {
      "id": "2110749836450713896",
      "text": "Meet NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL\n\nOur new open model combines reasoning and tool use with text, image, document, and video understanding for long-running AI agents.\n\n120B total parameters with 12B active 🧵 https://t.co/BcbED05qSG",
      "author": {
        "screenName": "NVIDIAAI",
        "name": "NVIDIA AI"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2110804342487810232",
    "text": "And another one, this time for your laptop. ⚡️\n\nAlongside Nemotron 3.5 Super VL, meet NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt. Built for local AI agents on RTX Spark with 74B parameters in just 24GB of memory.\n\nCheck it out ⬇ https://t.co/H8NQF2eEwQ",
