  {
    "id": "2110799078497960084",
    "text": "When the brand synonymous with car safety for almost 100 years teams up with AI, amazing things happen. 🚗\n\nWe’re expanding our partnership with Volvo Cars to advance safe automated driving: Volvo’s safety expertise will come together with the NVIDIA Hyperion, Halos OS and Alpamayo Stack driving software, debuting in a next-generation Volvo car.\n\nRead the news: https://t.co/NrqeVYGLC4",
