    "id": "2110784129658691756",
    "text": "An idea can only go so far without the computing power to test it.\n\n@JensenHuang joined Wallenberg Investments’ Marcus Wallenberg, @Spotify’s @eldsjal, and Sferical AI’s Jenny Nordlöw to celebrate the launch of Sferical One, a shared AI supercomputer powered by NVIDIA.\n\nMore computing power to help researchers and businesses turn ideas into breakthroughs. 🇸🇪",
