    "id": "2110600083892785270",
    "text": "Hello, Stockholm. 🇸🇪\n\nFrom the podcasts we discover to the robots working in factories, the Nordics are building with NVIDIA.\n\nSpotify is making podcast recommendations more efficient. ABB Robotics is helping engineers train and test robots in simulation. And startups are adapting open models for work ranging from Swedish transcription to patent research.\n\nBehind these applications are investments in computing power and a community of researchers, entrepreneurs, and businesses bringing new ideas to life.\n\nExplore the Nordics’ technology ecosystem ahead of GTC Berlin: https://t.co/tQRETV7PBF",
